Real passkey assertions

fixture.json in this directory holds WebAuthn assertions copied from the test data of three
projects. The authenticator data, client data, signatures and public keys are their values,
re-encoded where noted in README.md; no source file is copied.

  base-org/webauthn-sol
    repository: https://github.com/base-org/webauthn-sol
    commit:     619f20ab0f074fef41066ee4ab24849a913263b2
    file:       test/WebAuthn.t.sol (test_chrome, test_safari)
    licence:    MIT

  Yubico/java-webauthn-server
    repository: https://github.com/Yubico/java-webauthn-server
    commit:     e63ea7d98a4974c29ad42084d2704a4e400b7c3a
    file:       webauthn-server-core/src/test/scala/com/yubico/webauthn/test/RealExamples.scala
                (AppleAttestationIos, AppleAttestationMacos, YubikeyBio_5_5_4, YubiKey5Nfc,
                YubiKey5cNfc)
    licence:    BSD-2-Clause, the Yubico AB section of the repository's COPYING file

  go-webauthn/webauthn
    repository: https://github.com/go-webauthn/webauthn
    commit:     7ae82c9ad5f84c997a1f9acd72460dbbdfbfce3c
    file:       protocol/assertion_test.go (testAssertionResponses["success"])
    licence:    BSD-3-Clause

fixture.json, generate.py, PasskeyRealAssertionFixture.sol and README.md are part of this
repository and fall under its own licence, GPL-3.0-or-later. The licences of the three sources
follow.

